 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : CBCUS01C.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS Batch PL/I Program (BMP)                        */
 /* Function    : Customer Data Refresh - Load customer master        */
 /* Converted from COBOL batch: app/cbl/CBCUS01C.cbl                 */
